<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <!--
    ============================================================================
    DESIGN MOCKUP ONLY — hardcoded, not wired up.

    Layout matched to courses/show:
    - Full-width sticky Header at the top.
    - Flex container for Sidebar (left) and Main content (right).
    - Main content gets bg-white, rounded-tl-panel, and scrolls internally.
    - Hero panels get bg-surface-tint and strictly NO SHADOWS to contrast
      against the white main background.

    Profile layout (Google Classroom-inspired):
    - Content is a centered column (max-w-5xl) instead of edge-to-edge.
    - Hero = banner band (primary-container-alt) + identity row. For a student
      the avatar overlaps the band edge; "Remove From Course" sits top-right of
      the identity row instead of floating in a 3-column grid.
    - Status + Supervisor are a compact facts strip under the identity, split
      by a hairline (no more 3-col grid).
    - Group Members is its own section (heading + hairline rule) rendered as a
      single divided list, Classroom "People" style, not nested cards in the hero.
    - Section headings use the styleguide scale (DM Sans 22/400/28).
    - Project card is full-width with the header/body/footer separated by
      spacing instead of three stacked borders.
    - Status pill, outline button and card title weight follow /styleguide.
    ============================================================================
  -->
  <head>
    <title>Student &amp; Group Profile | ProPro</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icon.png" type="image/png">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Loaded Tailwind v4 Browser Build to support your @theme tokens -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>

    <!-- Injected Styleguide Theme -->
    <style type="text/tailwindcss">
      @theme {
        --color-on-surface: #3c4043;
        --color-on-surface-strong: #1f1f1f;
        --color-on-surface-variant: #5f6368;
        --color-on-surface-disabled: #9aa0a6;
        --color-on-surface-muted: #747775;
        --color-surface: #ffffff;
        --color-surface-tint: #f8fafd;
        --color-surface-variant: #f1f3f4;
        --color-surface-hover: #f8f9fa;
        --color-surface-variant-deep: #e1e3e1;

        --color-outline: #dadce0;
        --color-outline-variant: #e0e0e0;
        --color-outline-soft: #c4c7c5;
        --color-outline-strong: #c4c4c4;

        --color-primary: #1a73e8;
        --color-primary-strong: #0b57d0;
        --color-primary-container-alt: #d3e3fd;

        --color-success: #137333;
        --color-success-container: #e6f4ea;
        --color-error: #c5221f;
        --color-error-hover: #a50e0e;
        --color-error-container: #fce8e6;

        --radius-panel: 28px;
        --radius-card: 8px;
        --spacing-header: 3.5rem;
      }

      #app-sidebar[data-collapsed="true"] {
        overflow: visible;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-surface-tint text-on-surface font-['Roboto',sans-serif]" data-controller="sidebar">

    <!-- ============================================================== -->
    <!-- HEADER (Full width, sticky at top)                             -->
